{"catch":"在地窟中生存。擁抱殺戮。","desc":"《地窟屠殺》（Crypt Carnage）是一款節奏明快、以波次為基礎的復古第一人稱射擊遊戲。你將進入一個充滿怪物、裝甲巨獸和噩夢級首領的詛咒地下墓穴。每一輪都是對彈藥、升級和生存空間的拼命爭奪，因為敵群會步步緊逼，競技場也將變成一個殺戮禁區。疊加強力道具，即時切換荒誕武器，並保持移動——因為在地下室裡，原地踏步就意味著死亡。","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2026-04-23","genres":["射擊 / 動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"size":"Switch 2 0.6GB / Switch 0.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/88a550f3e8c9d3f7f7491e986ab115f1e3fe2ea5eaf5498575269a1956c501f7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a34b30e02b485eaaf64398f03a2bdecb6f22017a94e1f0b465b990435f7f09d0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d86033448e01cebd2d8a5a032e66c0b36ce6e0d5dd9e0837f331486f6f186cdf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7d0bd4b4be742658ba1b9a0f69e58b0991b93b0d7a8eac5af44234dbb9dac637.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f3854a44f2eec407df3722d541fc1e12ae33d6240db8c16a8875f7c9fc366a1b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/da06190eeecf4d2838dd8049c9d4b089753bf6a56b089b49107365b22382a53e.jpg"]}